(13. Phased migration strategy) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Phase 0 - Due diligence hardening, 2-4 weeks) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(- Resolve network access and perform full local clones of all six repositories.) Tj
T*
(- Run repository-level static analysis, test sampling, dependency audits, and local ) Tj
T*
(bootstraps for Open edX and Canvas.) Tj
T*
(- Validate AGPL obligations with counsel.) Tj
T*
(- Produce a canonical Syrka learning event schema.) Tj
T*
(- Identify the minimum viable Open edX installation profile.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Phase 1 - Bounded Open edX pilot, 6-10 weeks) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(- Deploy Open edX in an isolated environment.) Tj
T*
(- Integrate Syrka identity through SSO/OIDC where feasible.) Tj
T*
(- Create an event export pipeline into Syrka's Supabase/PostgreSQL environment.) Tj
T*
(- Build initial XBlock or LTI proof of concept for capability evidence capture.) Tj
T*
(- Map Open edX events to Syrka evidence entities.) Tj
T*
(- Keep learner-facing Syrka UX in Next.js where possible.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
