(- Define canonical events: learning.activity.started, assessment.submitted, ) Tj
T*
(assessment.evaluated, capability.evidence.observed, credential.claim.issued, ) Tj
T*
(collaboration.signal.detected, and related schemas.) Tj
T*
(- Implement event ingestion, validation, provenance, idempotency, and replay.) Tj
T*
(- Store operational projections in Supabase/PostgreSQL.) Tj
T*
(- Store capability relationships in a graph database or graph-compatible layer.) Tj
T*
(- Add vector indexes for evidence retrieval and LLM grounding.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
