(- Build Career Intent Engine and Odyssey recommendations.) Tj
T*
(- Integrate market signals, research intelligence, GitHub evidence, and employer feedback.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Phase 4 - UX replacement and module extraction, 20-40 weeks) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(- Replace learner, faculty, employer, and ministry workflows with Syrka-native Next.js ) Tj
T*
(experiences.) Tj
