stream
BT
/F1 10 Tf
14 TL
54 740 Td
() Tj
T*
(14. Consequences) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Positive) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(- Syrka avoids wasting years rebuilding commodity LMS functionality.) Tj
T*
(- Open edX provides the best combination of scalable learning runtime, extensibility, ) Tj
T*
(events, Python ecosystem, and modern frontend direction.) Tj
T*
(- The architecture protects Syrka's strategic systems from LMS lock-in.) Tj
T*
(- XBlocks and LTI provide practical hooks for AI-native assessment and evidence capture.) Tj
T*
(- The anti-corruption layer gives Syrka freedom to modernize incrementally.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Negative) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(- Open edX is operationally heavy.) Tj
T*
(- The default MySQL data layer does not align with Supabase PostgreSQL.) Tj
T*
(- AGPL obligations require careful legal/product planning.) Tj
T*
(- The team must maintain a boundary between Open edX domain concepts and Syrka canonical ) Tj
T*
(capability concepts.) Tj
T*
(- Full local clone/test due diligence must still be completed when network access permits.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(15. Final recommendation) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Choose the hybrid approach: use Open edX as the primary LMS foundation and learning runtime,) Tj
T*
( but build Syrka's intelligence, ontology, graph, career, credential, employer, government, ) Tj
T*
(and workforce mobility systems as independent Syrka-native services.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Open edX is selected because it has the strongest alignment with Syrka's need for modular ) Tj
T*
(learning experiences, event-rich educational telemetry, AI/ML-friendly Python ) Tj
T*
(infrastructure, React-compatible modernization, and scalable online learning patterns. ) Tj
T*
(Moodle and Canvas are stronger conventional LMS products in certain institutional workflows,) Tj
T*
( but Syrka's defining advantage is not conventional LMS completeness. Syrka's advantage is ) Tj
T*
(converting educational activity into trustworthy capability intelligence and workforce ) Tj
T*
(mobility infrastructure.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(The company should not bet its future on a permanent fork of any LMS monolith. It should use) Tj
T*
( Open edX to accelerate the operational layer, then systematically move the center of ) Tj
T*
(gravity to Syrka's canonical event ledger, ontology, graph, inference, passport, and ) Tj
T*
(corridor services.) Tj
ET
endstream
